{
  "harness": 1,
  "name": "2707-net-http",
  "about": "HTTP (1.3): the mod serves HTTP on a tcp_listen and a tls_listen and requests from them: Content-Length with a header, chunked with an extension and a trailer, gzip undone and RAW, a 302 followed, an answer to the connection's end, HEAD, a 100 then 204, a POST echoed back whole (Host, User-Agent Nebula/<version> <mod id>, Accept-Encoding, Connection, Content-Length, the mod's header, the body), a 303 after a POST as a GET, https against the mod's root, NO_REDIRECT; 6 redirects LIMIT, a redirect to a far host and from https to http DENIED (Net.RedirectRefused), a body past 64 MiB TOO_LARGE, 400 ms without an answer TIMEOUT, not HTTP FORMAT; the mistakes ARGUMENT, a host luma.json does not name DENIED, requests to LUMA_NET_REQUESTS_MOST with the net.internet one still open (both services count: 7 more) then LIMIT, send on a request HANDLE",
  "proves": [
    "services.net.local",
    "services.net.internet",
    "services.net.http",
    "services.net.tls",
    "services.registry"
  ],
  "mods": [
    "../mods/net-http"
  ],
